{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2f/70qddg09npalgcxw6smmzvf8czuqcfo.mp3","text":"我看过你的排班日程，现在确实是休息时间吧？那么，多有打扰。","alt":"voice_cn/char_202_demkni/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c9/3dr4utsegsaqcv988i9i8c3q3iwknq1.mp3","text":"万物的演化本就是不可动摇的自然法则。莱茵生命却妄图修改它，甚至想要支配它，多么愚蠢的图谋......","alt":"voice_cn/char_202_demkni/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/bf/et57fajbpvj0t25tf0wbl85wwte52w4.mp3","text":"作为研究者，你是否也参与过一些不应触碰的实验？没有的话，自然最好。","alt":"voice_cn/char_202_demkni/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/8a/8v16juy7gdx8xaqw1km2icvvbnx8tve.mp3","text":"你不觉得罗德岛太喧闹了吗？工作中就该保持安静、专注。你该严格管束你的部下。","alt":"voice_cn/char_202_demkni/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:4/43/3lb5a2t7on85278xifwc0nzv564hb8f.mp3","text":"我真正的能力，与急救这种行为并无关联。不过，为了配合你的战术指挥，我简单地调整了这个能力的使用方法。","alt":"voice_cn/char_202_demkni/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/42/a0kron3a6ubzdx3k1a44h9ihb3lx1zn.mp3","text":"你是不是以为，钙质化法术会让生物变得脆弱？错了，我可以将钙精炼成坚硬的珐琅质。就让敌人试试看吧，没人摧毁得了我的防壁。","alt":"voice_cn/char_202_demkni/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1e/pf5o48djqed660wg38q3vffhabouvx8.mp3","text":"你看到了我和赫默吵架？家常便饭而已......抱歉，给你和罗德岛带来了麻烦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_202_demkni/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/42/dbook1dogaguxk1ub2v8yyj541wd627.mp3","text":"请你帮我转告伊芙利特，“无论今后发生什么，我都会保护你”......见面？不，我还没准备好去见她。","alt":"voice_cn/char_202_demkni/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/fb/e08s42ewtke8rd6t42faqp06fxlnny3.mp3","text":"即使身处绝境，也要将自己傲然挺立的身姿，永远地刻在重要的人眼中。这是我的底线，也是我生存的准则。你也会这样去做的，对吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_202_demkni/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2a/o2543gmepyn98w2m8mhqp8mkx09dr7q.mp3","text":"如果没有其他任务需要处理，我就先一步返回自己的房间了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_202_demkni/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:3/31/rktqxt03ujtxcdvpxqltl1k9vcbxgi2.mp3","text":"塞雷娅，原莱茵生命研究所实验组成员。至于现在......为了让偏离传统的事物回归正途，我需要罗德岛的协助。","alt":"voice_cn/char_202_demkni/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:9/99/24btmulq8k7ylmx1ahghkn745crvdeo.mp3","text":"你在干什么？","alt":"voice_cn/char_202_demkni/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:5/51/dnih9870iwjr8334ot8x1t866b20za6.mp3","text":"很好，如果想保持对下属的影响力，你必须时刻用自己的想法去推动他们。","alt":"voice_cn/char_202_demkni/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:3/32/c6nxmje8hdipm9gviquvrp5nu2sm25l.mp3","text":"晋升？我并不希望这是种特殊对待。只是，为了那个孩子，我确实需要你的协助，直到那些被扭曲过的法则，全都被修正为止......！","alt":"voice_cn/char_202_demkni/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a4/s0x6w86vox7g380snnmln1cke956zz7.mp3","text":"对于你的指挥，我有权进行监督，并提出相应意见。","alt":"voice_cn/char_202_demkni/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:d/da/t9zxxed22lwbk094zb0h5bsef2hg2qe.mp3","text":"把这次行动的简报，提交给我审核一下。","alt":"voice_cn/char_202_demkni/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:7/75/8rmbjtm1m8en656ay4tjdozdxdotfgi.mp3","text":"所有干员，必须严格遵守纪律。","alt":"voice_cn/char_202_demkni/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:1/15/rsg7ies3kos1xm8pl7tm3o6ncxorsi8.mp3","text":"就是他们制造了灾难，点燃了战争之火吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_202_demkni/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:3/36/1kaldg1h08q2d9blah8d18c751zbmpm.mp3","text":"让我来。","alt":"voice_cn/char_202_demkni/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/76/7xs7ou9yp8e8p3gfarmhnh2c5o5pqid.mp3","text":"压制他们。","alt":"voice_cn/char_202_demkni/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f0/6nujqn8p17llir74gn4aafy6eactjs6.mp3","text":"前进。","alt":"voice_cn/char_202_demkni/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f1/2no9lwg8hv2bqyfmp1y3qgrn1azgh3s.mp3","text":"害虫。","alt":"voice_cn/char_202_demkni/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e9/q6mwhn1xn9s6uxjqq4971uz6hafustp.mp3","text":"这种程度，又能阻止谁？","alt":"voice_cn/char_202_demkni/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/59/ig8bgaoexhdgkimgogujku4402evqke.mp3","text":"很快就会结束。","alt":"voice_cn/char_202_demkni/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/6c/8827cslxoemuspu6hep85y78y87rpeh.mp3","text":"凝固吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_202_demkni/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c5/0ws48k35n7bw9grv4ippoy3pyvnoujx.mp3","text":"不许放弃。","alt":"voice_cn/char_202_demkni/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d0/0umw5g0tf5g8il53tasx88i00l9gbv1.mp3","text":"你的战术是现代的，构思却相当古老。你究竟是什么人？","alt":"voice_cn/char_202_demkni/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:8/83/8bspiv1dp17v24yorl300whszsurqvf.mp3","text":"一切必须回归既有的秩序，我不准许任何人违背法则。","alt":"voice_cn/char_202_demkni/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:4/42/a3u4u788w9ehb5avzxswixlzddh21ov.mp3","text":"溃退的敌人也许正在呼叫援军，对残余敌人的搜索，不可怠慢。","alt":"voice_cn/char_202_demkni/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:0/05/p9999oyau9cerbojkp45f3ae7ek8gb7.mp3","text":"究竟是哪里搞错了......？","alt":"voice_cn/char_202_demkni/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:9/96/l6kvyj36swlf7clfxw10h0ucdyk3zui.mp3","text":"这个房间的布置很有意思，虽然，我个人更喜欢未来主义的设计。","alt":"voice_cn/char_202_demkni/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3f/nirqvvc1qnzrga3el9qx2asnycz8m7m.mp3","text":"嗯？什么？","alt":"voice_cn/char_202_demkni/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fb/8ig86nl8gwaxvcxwfxczjlgrqmixw50.mp3","text":"博士，有时间的话去补习一些过往的知识吧，你会在其中，发现许多有趣的事。","alt":"voice_cn/char_202_demkni/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0e/qq2mvfb7ok7luvwseex8t53davcgrx5.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_202_demkni/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b0/8ks0ak06raougrzr1qibscnxyirxl5d.mp3","text":"人生就是成长的堆砌，新的一年也好好磨练自己，博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_202_demkni/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ef/7695cqbf4rjojx4rzupmpawn8xdth7i.mp3","text":"博士，身体如何？","alt":"voice_cn/char_202_demkni/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7d/0fz11y3bxaftefe83hpe8j74vbrfhx0.mp3","text":"我看过你的排班日程，现在确实是休息时间吧？那么，多有打扰。","alt":"voice/char_202_demkni/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b7/07513hxcry94qzh7f1x3knkfq31arxl.mp3","text":"万物的演化本就是不可动摇的自然法则。莱茵生命却妄图修改它，甚至想要支配它，多么愚蠢的图谋......","alt":"voice/char_202_demkni/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/34/0p013lyqkrrtw341x01dbm3s4cqaq3l.mp3","text":"作为研究者，你是否也参与过一些不应触碰的实验？没有的话，自然最好。","alt":"voice/char_202_demkni/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/5c/2xrrq3i5c2tkfezoaqczhalwwmk7s6d.mp3","text":"你不觉得罗德岛太喧闹了吗？工作中就该保持安静、专注。你该严格管束你的部下。","alt":"voice/char_202_demkni/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:4/49/n7ta44utsa7u05vnyjcuiyma9x65kb0.mp3","text":"我真正的能力，与急救这种行为并无关联。不过，为了配合你的战术指挥，我简单地调整了这个能力的使用方法。","alt":"voice/char_202_demkni/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/67/on8cmz6cj6alq72yxn6q7bq6ex21yy0.mp3","text":"你是不是以为，钙质化法术会让生物变得脆弱？错了，我可以将钙精炼成坚硬的珐琅质。就让敌人试试看吧，没人摧毁得了我的防壁。","alt":"voice/char_202_demkni/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ec/2j5n5pj4e7mfp8nrh9ojepbs4krug2v.mp3","text":"你看到了我和赫默吵架？家常便饭而已......抱歉，给你和罗德岛带来了麻烦。","alt":"voice/char_202_demkni/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/a7/ljw39fq4m61g52wlmmrplwbnnei11lp.mp3","text":"请你帮我转告伊芙利特，“无论今后发生什么，我都会保护你”......见面？不，我还没准备好去见她。","alt":"voice/char_202_demkni/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/ad/ecu3pw4lazdh8gc9zbgvbf5uvgvnhsp.mp3","text":"即使身处绝境，也要将自己傲然挺立的身姿，永远地刻在重要的人眼中。这是我的底线，也是我生存的准则。你也会这样去做的，对吗？","alt":"voice/char_202_demkni/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:a/ab/56k8due721xiz655jgnqqxlrrse7r0e.mp3","text":"如果没有其他任务需要处理，我就先一步返回自己的房间了。","alt":"voice/char_202_demkni/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8c/py67u9cdqui9kgqt80famrn7cybttvf.mp3","text":"塞雷娅，原莱茵生命研究所实验组成员。至于现在......为了让偏离传统的事物回归正途，我需要罗德岛的协助。","alt":"voice/char_202_demkni/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:8/81/3mipy6e5rkxpt28sgupit8joykokk14.mp3","text":"你在干什么？","alt":"voice/char_202_demkni/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d6/ojgcwkgcx747683x836y7wq2jp35tli.mp3","text":"很好，如果想保持对下属的影响力，你必须时刻用自己的想法去推动他们。","alt":"voice/char_202_demkni/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:6/60/ltzaa1lytryjvbev43w8920q7u4z9k1.mp3","text":"晋升？我并不希望这是种特殊对待。只是，为了那个孩子，我确实需要你的协助，直到那些被扭曲过的法则，全都被修正为止......！","alt":"voice/char_202_demkni/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8f/o6lapdpwttt4nccqimb1dwaxuqfh4cj.mp3","text":"对于你的指挥，我有权进行监督，并提出相应意见。","alt":"voice/char_202_demkni/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:6/68/sidjhjrg97v5l5emuwalw6f1p3ditti.mp3","text":"把这次行动的简报，提交给我审核一下。","alt":"voice/char_202_demkni/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:a/af/gorg853jj5281j459dxridnqkkfxdmu.mp3","text":"所有干员，必须严格遵守纪律。","alt":"voice/char_202_demkni/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c7/riwew7aqyjlyv8wjhms1qxyxbfabvn2.mp3","text":"就是他们制造了灾难，点燃了战争之火吗？","alt":"voice/char_202_demkni/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:9/92/gn0u6rdgmnpadsr0jz2s7ema5ri1ic2.mp3","text":"让我来。","alt":"voice/char_202_demkni/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/3f/cflgfs8v6ajlze1kw5rxk54z58966rn.mp3",